        "subject": "LU-18312 tests: skip sanity 123ac on old clients",
        "message": "LU-18312 tests: skip sanity 123ac on old clients\n\nThe b2_15 sanity test_123a_base() re-checks a slow statahead pass\nwith \"[ $((a && b)) ]\", which is always true. Once a statahead\npass is over 5% and 2 seconds slower than the one without, the\nre-check always fails the test, even if the re-run shows only\ntiming noise. Newer clients fixed this in LU-18288 (2.16.0).\nSkip 123ac on clients older than 2.16.0 in the server side except\nlist, as nearly all of the failures are b2_15 client interop\nsessions.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I874982a9206fa775f695f9503cd34bac97301b1b\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
